 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 rf←#.APLGUI.APLGUI

⍝ First we check whether "Version" returns a valid result:
 v←1⊃rf.Version
 v←{⍵↑⍨¯1+⌊/⍵⍳'+-'}v      ⍝ Remove build ID
 f1←~5≤⍴v
 f1∨←2≠'.'+.=v
 f1∨←~∧/⎕D∊⍨v~'.'

